name 'aif_pl_umpire-L18-2-python'
title 'title'
description 'description here'

markdown <<MARKDOWN
<h1>UMPIRE Strategy</h1>
<p>The <b>UMPIRE</b> strategy is a simple way to help students, or anyone new to coding, think through their code step by step, just like an umpire watches carefully and makes decisions.</p>
<p>It's especially useful when writing or debugging Python code.</p>

<h2>UMPIRE Steps</h2>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; max-width: 900px; margin: auto;">

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px;">
    <div style="background: #E4E2F8; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 100px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #1F1976;">U</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-left: 6px solid #4C42CF; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 10px;">
      <h3 style="color: #1F1976; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 6px 0;">Understand</h3>
      <p style="color: #666666; font-style: italic; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">What's the goal?</p>
      <p style="color: #222222; margin: 0;">First, figure out what the code is supposed to do.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px;">
    <div style="background: #E4E2F8; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 100px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #1F1976;">M</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-left: 6px solid #4C42CF; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 10px;">
      <h3 style="color: #1F1976; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 6px 0;">Make a plan</h3>
      <p style="color: #666666; font-style: italic; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">What will go in the code?</p>
      <p style="color: #222222; margin: 0;">Think through the steps before writing anything.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px;">
    <div style="background: #E4E2F8; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 100px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #1F1976;">P</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-left: 6px solid #4C42CF; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 10px;">
      <h3 style="color: #1F1976; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 6px 0;">Produce</h3>
      <p style="color: #222222; margin: 0;">Now, write the code.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px;">
    <div style="background: #E4E2F8; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 100px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #1F1976;">I</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-left: 6px solid #4C42CF; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 10px;">
      <h3 style="color: #1F1976; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 6px 0;">Inspect</h3>
      <p style="color: #222222; margin: 0;">Run the code. Does it do what it's supposed to?</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px;">
    <div style="background: #E4E2F8; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 100px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #1F1976;">R</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-left: 6px solid #4C42CF; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 10px;">
      <h3 style="color: #1F1976; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 6px 0;">Review</h3>
      <p style="color: #222222; margin: 0;">Look back at your code. Can anything be improved or simplified?</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px;">
    <div style="background: #E4E2F8; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 100px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #1F1976;">E</h1>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-left: 6px solid #4C42CF; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 10px;">
      <h3 style="color: #1F1976; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 6px 0;">Explain</h3>
      <p style="color: #222222; margin: 0;">How did it work? Think or talk about what each line did.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

---

<br>

<p>As you plan out your code in the next level, try using the <b>UMPIRE</b> strategy!</p>

<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0;">
<p>➡️<b> The UMPIRE strategy is introduced to students in Lesson 5. You can find more details in the full </b><a href="https://studio.code.org/s/aif2-2025/lessons/5" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-weight:bold;">lesson plan</a>.</p>
</div>
MARKDOWN
